    "data_quality_notes": "The reported gross prior year development of GBP 24.4m relates specifically to the 2020 Closed Year of Account. The report also states a net deficit of GBP 7.0m in ultimate claims for the 2022 calendar year (page 36) and a net release of GBP 67.771m from net claims incurred for prior years during 2022 (page 17). These figures are contradictory, and the gross figure for overall calendar year 2022 prior year development is not explicitly stated. The GBP 11.4m 'short-tail account' release was split between Property and Marine based on their premium mix, which is an inference. The claims development triangle is distorted by the acceptance of Reinsurance to Close Premium from Syndicate 6103 at 1 January 2022, making it unreliable for calculating prior year development.",
